From 1000000000000000000000000000000000000475 Tue Sep  1 00:00:00 2026
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 21:15:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] pstore: match Gemini CPU9 ledger reader mappings

CPU8 publishes its retained transition record through a write-combined
mapping. The progress owner and CPU9 ledger immediately reopen that same
physical slot with ioremap() before validating its two CRC copies. The first
progress-enabled device attempt completed CPU8 but returned -EBADMSG from the
stage-1 progress begin before issuing any CPU9 request; changed-cycle recovery
then decoded the CPU8 record successfully.

Use ioremap_wc() for both CPU8 readers so their mapping attribute matches the
existing writer and the adjacent CPU9/progress ledger mappings. Keep all wire
formats, validation, request bounds, and failure behavior unchanged.
---
 fs/pstore/gemini_cpu9_progress_ledger.c   | 2 +-
 fs/pstore/gemini_cpu9_transition_ledger.c | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/fs/pstore/gemini_cpu9_progress_ledger.c b/fs/pstore/gemini_cpu9_progress_ledger.c
index 27be196..6d0c2be 100644
--- a/fs/pstore/gemini_cpu9_progress_ledger.c
+++ b/fs/pstore/gemini_cpu9_progress_ledger.c
@@ -185,7 +185,7 @@ int gemini_cpu9_progress_begin(u64 cpu8_attempt_id)
 		ret = -ENODEV;
 		goto out_unlock;
 	}
-	cpu8_slot = ioremap(GEMINI_CPU9_PROGRESS_CPU8_BASE,
+	cpu8_slot = ioremap_wc(GEMINI_CPU9_PROGRESS_CPU8_BASE,
 			    GEMINI_TRANSITION_LEDGER_SLOT_SIZE);
 	if (!cpu8_slot) {
 		ret = -ENOMEM;
diff --git a/fs/pstore/gemini_cpu9_transition_ledger.c b/fs/pstore/gemini_cpu9_transition_ledger.c
index ae43982..12af74a 100644
--- a/fs/pstore/gemini_cpu9_transition_ledger.c
+++ b/fs/pstore/gemini_cpu9_transition_ledger.c
@@ -219,7 +219,7 @@ int gemini_cpu9_ledger_begin(u64 cpu8_attempt_id, u64 cpu9_attempt_id)
 		ret = -ENODEV;
 		goto out_unlock;
 	}
-	cpu8_slot = ioremap(GEMINI_CPU9_LEDGER_CPU8_BASE,
+	cpu8_slot = ioremap_wc(GEMINI_CPU9_LEDGER_CPU8_BASE,
 			    GEMINI_TRANSITION_LEDGER_SLOT_SIZE);
 	if (!cpu8_slot) {
 		ret = -ENOMEM;
-- 
